GNU General Public License, version 2 (see LICENSE).

src/pantograph_async/resources/repository_client_contract.patch modifies
sources of the Pantograph Lean REPL, as forked at
https://github.com/jajos12/Pantograph (base commit
0dd5d2225e2d093f66a4b6231c1aa35004f2c8f3), originally developed at
https://github.com/stanford-centaur/Pantograph. Those sources remain under
their upstream license; this package ships only the patch and does not
bundle, build, or download a REPL.

The client speaks the wire protocol of that custom REPL. It does not include
or depend on PyPantograph.
